1
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,719
Who here is family to the injured?

2
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:07,079
She's their daughter-in-law.

3
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,519
I'm sorry, neither patient made it.

4
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:11,760
We did everything we could.

5
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:12,840
So,

6
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,439
have the patients' immediate family

7
00:01:15,439 --> 00:01:17,079
come in to process the death certificates.

8
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,400
Nana.

9
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:25,519
Have a seat.

10
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,519
Does Jianguo know yet?

11
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,159
Hello?

12
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,439
Jianguo, it's Aihua.

13
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,480
Where are you?

14
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,319
I'm on the highway. What's up?

15
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:54,439
Here's the thing.

16
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,959
Your dad was driving,

17
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:58,040
taking your mom and wife to burn incense...

18
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,280
They got into an accident on the way.

19
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,359
Hello?

20
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,319
Jianguo?

21
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,120
Jianguo!

22
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,000
You jinx!

23
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,919
Who do you think you're hitting?

24
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,639
What are you doing?

25
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,479
What do you think you're doing?

26
00:02:34,479 --> 00:02:35,280
How dare you show your face here!

27
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,800
What's your problem?

28
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,639
What are you doing? Who are you hitting?

29
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:37,919
Get out!

30
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,280
My dad, my mom, my brother...

31
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,240
They're all gone, just like that!

32
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:52,840
I know it was wrong of me to hit you that day,

33
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:55,639
but I hope you understand how I feel.

34
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,840
I understand.

35
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:01,639
Fine, I won't beat around the bush.

36
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,840
I know you're living here,

37
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,240
but this house is registered in my dad's name.

38
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,639
This house should belong to me.

39
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:09,560
Why should it?

40
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:12,240
This house belongs to Jianguo.

41
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,039
Now that Jianguo is gone,

42
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:16,240
it belongs to his wife, Nana!

43
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:17,759
What right do you have?

44
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,240
They just passed away,

45
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,639
and you're already here fighting over the estate? Shameless!

46
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:25,159
If she weren't a husband-jinx,

47
00:03:25,159 --> 00:03:26,759
would my entire family be dead?

48
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,759
Who are you calling a husband-jinx?

49
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:28,479
Her!

50
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,199
You're the husband-jinx!

51
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,319
Your entire family are husband-jinxes!

52
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,319
Aihua.

53
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:32,800
Stop dragging innocent people into this.

54
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:35,280
Sit down.

55
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,719
This house is under my father-in-law's name,

56
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,840
but back when Jianguo and I

57
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,680
got married, they promised it to me.

58
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:52,560
Now that they're gone,

59
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,759
if you want it, fine.

60
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,919
Give me a quarter of the house's value,

61
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:55,759
and I'll move out.

62
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,599
Nana is being sensible.

63
00:03:58,879 --> 00:04:02,039
Look, the house is currently worth 800,000.

64
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,680
A quarter is 200,000, so I'll give you 200,000,

65
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,840
and the house goes to us.

66
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:09,560
I agree, but since she slapped me,

67
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,039
I demand an extra 10%.

68
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,919
Hey, how can you—

69
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,319
Don't say another word!

70
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,879
She'll add another 10% in a second!

71
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,160
Fine, Nana, we'll leave for now.

72
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,240
We'll be in touch later.

73
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:20,600
Let's get this settled as soon as possible.

74
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,360
Let's go.

75
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,519
Just you wait!

76
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,720
Don't touch that!

77
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,600
Let's go.

78
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,600
What a piece of work.

79
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:37,560
Are you crazy or just stupid?

80
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:40,319
Why give up a perfectly good house

81
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:41,720
for that pitiful amount of cash?

82
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,279
Property values are still going up!

83
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:47,759
My mind has been such a mess lately.

84
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:50,079
Every single day, all I dream about

85
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,600
are images of dead people.

86
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:55,079
I don't want to live here. I want to move.

87
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,839
I could tell you didn't look right.

88
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,160
Nana,

89
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:07,759
you've been like a different person lately,

90
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:10,000
so out of it all day long.

91
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,720
Maybe it's just from everything...

92
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,399
all the chaos that's been going on.

93
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,079
No.

94
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:20,199
There must be something unclean on you.

95
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:24,519
Sis, I used to be a teacher.

96
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,680
I don't believe in that stuff.

97
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,120
How can you not believe it?

98
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:31,319
Three family members died one after another!

99
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,279
Better safe than sorry, sister.

100
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:41,800
I pulled some strings to get

101
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:43,279
the best master in our city

102
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,839
to come and exorcise this for you.

103
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,519
Even wealthy bosses can't get him!

104
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,199
What kind of master?

105
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:56,040
Oh, it's almost time.

106
00:05:57,879 --> 00:05:59,160
Tidy yourself up properly.

107
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,439
Look at yourself.

108
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:02,480
You look like you haven't slept in days.

109
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,959
Speak of Cao Cao, and here he is!

110
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,120
I'll go get the door.

111
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:16,800
Master!

112
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,160
Please come in, come in!

113
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,879
Please have a seat, Master.

114
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,319
Master.

115
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:48,839
Here.

116
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,439
Please, have some water after your trip.

117
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,600
Come here.

118
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,000
Hurry up, hurry up.

119
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,360
Come over here.

120
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,240
Master,

121
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,879
here's the situation.

122
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:09,439
My sister here...

123
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:13,079
Three family members passed away in a row,

124
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:15,399
and she hasn't been herself at all.

125
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:16,040
She isn't Li Na.

126
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,319
Please take a look at her.

127
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,160
Between you and that man,

128
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,000
is the soul trapping the body,

129
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,040
or is the body trapping the soul?

130
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,480
Which man?

131
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,680
Who do you think?

132
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,480
Lately, I've been dreaming of a man.

133
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,879
He said he was a lawyer.

134
00:07:35,439 --> 00:07:36,160
And then?

135
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,160
Don't scare me.

136
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:38,920
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

137
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:41,439
He told me the car accident wasn't my fault.

138
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:45,360
They caused the crash themselves.

139
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,720
It was just an accident.

140
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,720
He's right.

141
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,000
Know Iron-Crutch Li of the Eight Immortals?

142
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,639
He was a real historical figure.

143
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,759
His name was Li Xuan.

144
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:58,199
There's a Taoist legend...

145
00:07:58,199 --> 00:08:01,079
...that he was once a handsome Taoist priest.

146
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,560
One day, he practiced astral projection,

147
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,759
the art of sending out one's spirit.

148
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:08,160
His soul left his physical body...

149
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,920
...to meet his master, Grand Supreme Elderly Lord, on Mount Hua.

150
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,480
Before leaving,

151
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,879
he instructed his disciple, Yang Zi:

152
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:16,439
"If I don't return in seven days,

153
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,879
cremate my body."

154
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:20,079
Yet on the sixth day,

155
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,199
seeing his master hadn't returned,

156
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:24,079
and with his mother gravely ill,

157
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:25,240
the disciple was desperate to return home.

158
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,800
So he cremated the body ahead of time.

159
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,480
But on the seventh day,

160
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,199
Li Xuan's soul returned,

161
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,080
only to find his body destroyed.

162
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,720
With nowhere for his soul to go,

163
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,840
he had to wander the wilderness.

164
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,720
Then he found a starved corpse.

165
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,840
The corpse was disheveled and filthy,

166
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,440
lame and crippled.

167
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,240
In desperation,

168
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,799
he had no choice but to inhabit that body.

169
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:51,080
He spat water on a bamboo staff,

170
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,519
turning it into an iron crutch.

171
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,519
Ever since, we've known him as...

172
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:58,480
...that disheveled, lame Iron-Crutch Li.

173
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,240
I think I saw that on TV.

174
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,639
His situation...

175
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:04,360
...is just like Iron-Crutch Li's.

176
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,519
I don't mean your sister.

177
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:07,519
Your sister is at most like that...

178
00:09:07,519 --> 00:09:09,240
...disheveled, filthy...

179
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,320
...starved corpse.

180
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,840
In this kind of situation,

181
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:15,120
the trendy term for it is...

182
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,759
...body snatching.

183
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,720
He snatched your body.

184
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,039
His soul entered your body.

185
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:20,919
Now think about it.

186
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:24,120
What will happen to your soul over time?

187
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:25,480
What will happen?

188
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,679
It will be utterly obliterated.

189
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,679
But now, I just can't get rid of him.

190
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,679
Every time I dream, I dream of him.

191
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,840
Whenever I dream, I see him.

192
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:38,440
He doesn't speak to me.

193
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:39,440
He just...

194
00:09:39,879 --> 00:09:41,240
stands at all kinds of...

195
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,840
bloody murder scenes.

196
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,399
Your soul...

197
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:48,000
has already been affected by his primordial spirit.

198
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:51,399
And dreaming, as we in the mystical arts say,

199
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:54,000
is simply another layer of illusion.

200
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:55,200
In Dream of the Red Chamber,

201
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:58,080
Jia Baoyu's spirit roamed the Land of Illusion.

202
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,360
The people there...

203
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,320
didn't exist in the mortal realm.

204
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:05,000
Yet the physical body exists in the real world,

205
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:08,279
while the soul uses dreams as a vessel

206
00:10:08,279 --> 00:10:09,559
to wander between heaven and earth.

207
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,639
That's all it is.

208
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,000
I can feel...

209
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:14,360
he still has so much left unfinished.

210
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,279
But sometimes, I'm also affected

211
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,799
by what he went through.

212
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,720
That's not hard to explain.

213
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,799
Take parallel universe theory—

214
00:10:25,679 --> 00:10:27,000
in our ancient texts,

215
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,480
there's a saying:

216
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,440
"A world in every thought,

217
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,519
an instant in every mind."

218
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:34,919
Whenever a thought of him arises in your mind,

219
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:37,080
another you is born into this world.

220
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:39,000
Outsiders see you as Li Na,

221
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:42,159
but two souls actually share a single body.

222
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,559
Scientists call this

223
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:45,960
consciousness projection.

224
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,200
And in our traditional lore,

225
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:48,559
it's also called spirit ferrying.

226
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:50,919
In another world, his soul's

227
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,200
unfulfilled desires

228
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:54,399
are carried on through your body.

229
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:58,159
So, you can see him, hear him,

230
00:10:58,159 --> 00:11:00,759
and eventually speak with his thoughts.

231
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,039
Then what am I supposed to do?

232
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,080
I don't want this!

233
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:05,879
You can't go back.

234
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,120
At least, not by walking away.

235
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,559
Look here:

236
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:15,600
if you want to sever your physical bond with him,

237
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:19,720
you must first establish a spiritual connection.

238
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,799
It's like two sides of a mirror.

239
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,399
Only when both mirrors are aligned

240
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,600
will the reflection disappear.

241
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,679
Then how do I connect them?

242
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:33,240
You came to me far too late.

243
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,759
Master!

244
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:35,759
Master!

245
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,759
Please don't leave, Master!

246
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,399
Aihua,

247
00:11:39,759 --> 00:11:41,879
it's not my place to interfere with their karma.

248
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,440
This world has always been

249
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,360
a dream within a dream.

250
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:48,519
Inside a dream,

251
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:51,440
what does it matter whose flesh belongs to whom?

252
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,960
Just take things as they come.

253
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,519
Who did you say that person was?

254
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:12,759
He's...

255
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,120
a male lawyer,

256
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,240
named Fu Ting.

257
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:19,879
Fu Ting?

258
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:27,240
There's no one by that name here.

259
00:12:27,679 --> 00:12:28,279
Sis,

260
00:12:29,519 --> 00:12:31,919
his memories are full of murder cases.

261
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:36,039
A live-in son-in-law killed a family of four,

262
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:38,159
and an office worker named Zhang Xiaomin

263
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,679
chopped her mother into nine pieces.

264
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:41,759
It terrified me.

265
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,200
I told you so.

266
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:46,240
You're definitely possessed.

267
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,200
Sis,

268
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:49,840
we should beg the Master to take a look.

269
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,559
Didn't the Master say he couldn't help?

270
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,480
When I stepped out just now,

271
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,120
didn't I go beg him?

272
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:57,840
He said there's only one way.

273
00:12:58,279 --> 00:13:00,960
You must be truly sincere,

274
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:02,879
and be willing to walk nine steps,

275
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,200
without looking back once.

276
00:13:07,159 --> 00:13:08,240
What's that supposed to mean?

277
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,679
I don't know either.

278
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,120
Anyway, he said

279
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:12,639
if you make up your mind,

280
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:14,840
go see him in three days.

281
00:13:52,159 --> 00:13:53,840
My master knew you were coming

282
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,320
and has been waiting for quite some time.

283
00:14:24,519 --> 00:14:25,320
You're here.

284
00:14:26,679 --> 00:14:27,240
Master.

285
00:14:27,879 --> 00:14:30,159
I sensed your aura long ago.

286
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:32,639
You have already endured three tribulations.

287
00:14:33,399 --> 00:14:34,200
Fire.

288
00:14:35,519 --> 00:14:36,399
Blood.

289
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:37,720
Dreams.

290
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,799
This time...

291
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:41,279
...it is the Tribulation of the Lost.

292
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,960
How did you know?

293
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,639
Between us,

294
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:48,519
we are bound by a hidden quantum thread.

295
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:51,399
You think you came here of your own free will,

296
00:14:51,759 --> 00:14:53,120
but in truth, a certain

297
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,919
dimensional rift chose you.

298
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,039
Then can I break free from him?

299
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:11,440
You're quite smart.

300
00:15:12,159 --> 00:15:13,879
Your doubts are completely justified.

301
00:15:15,759 --> 00:15:18,440
To detach, you must first connect.

302
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,759
Right now,

303
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:22,879
it's like you're living in two different worlds.

304
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:25,039
Your soul is over here,

305
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:28,080
and your body is over there.

306
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,200
Master...

307
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:35,159
my cousin said you have a way.

308
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,720
Tea from thousand-year-old trees.

309
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:48,600
A disciple of mine gave it to me.

310
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,360
Have a taste first.

311
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,039
Thank you.

312
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,519
Did your cousin not tell you?

313
00:16:14,759 --> 00:16:16,480
I didn't plan on taking this on.

314
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,399
She didn't mention it.

315
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,120
Well...

316
00:16:20,919 --> 00:16:23,639
Aihua never tells the whole story.

317
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,879
Very well.

318
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,000
Since you are already here,

319
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:30,440
and you truly wish to sever ties with him,

320
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:34,519
you still have misgivings, don't you?

321
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,080
Yes, exactly.

322
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,919
He said the car accident was only the beginning.

323
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:42,679
Will there... will there be more?

324
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,320
I have already reported to my cosmic master.

325
00:16:52,039 --> 00:16:53,759
He bestowed upon me an incantation and a formation

326
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:55,320
to return the soul to its vessel.

327
00:16:57,639 --> 00:16:59,120
That way, his soul can be

328
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,720
transmitted through space

329
00:17:02,679 --> 00:17:05,000
to connect with his physical form in the other realm.

330
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:06,960
Then...

331
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:08,960
Then he will finally be able to leave?

332
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,799
But to accomplish this,

333
00:17:11,039 --> 00:17:12,160
we require

334
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,680
an immensely powerful energy field.

335
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,440
Not ordinary energy from our mortal world.

336
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:22,119
And you cannot be the conduit for such energy.

337
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,359
It must be borne by me.

338
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:26,759
So to do this,

339
00:17:26,759 --> 00:17:28,880
we must first locate

340
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,720
a very special energy field,

341
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,759
which I will then absorb,

342
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,759
and then

343
00:17:34,799 --> 00:17:36,279
find a way to channel it to you.

344
00:17:40,759 --> 00:17:41,880
However,

345
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:46,119
the negative energy involved here is too immense.

346
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:48,640
Even for me, it will be an enormous burden.

347
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,359
It takes quite a heavy toll on the body.
